usage: j3c -e imgdiff a.png b.png [--tol N] [--max N] [--out diff.png]
  Counts pixels where any channel differs by more than --tol (default 0, per channel 0-255).
  Exit 0: count <= --max (default 0). Exit 1: more, or sizes differ. Exit 2: usage or unreadable PNG.
  --out writes a diff image (changed pixels red). Capture frames with `j3c doc testing`.
--- stderr
--- exit 0
